Scriptname Overture:Companions:EngineAdapter extends Overture:Companions:Adapter
{The fallback: a companion no adapter claims, answered from the engine alone. Its
own script so the registry can name it -- attaching the base Adapter next to its
subclasses would make "CastAs the base" ambiguous. It vouches for nothing (C6):
no conversation of Overture's, and no feeding of the store on its word.}
